  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global elimination of mercury in non-ferrous metals initiative, Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on cleaner processes, technological advancements, investment opportunities, and stakeholder engagement to foster a mercury-free supply chain (GEMINI Components 2, 3, and 4). This includes promoting the adoption of Best Available Technologies (BAT) and Best Environmental Practices (BEP), such as advanced mercury capture systems, improved process controls, and increased copper recycling. These measures are critical to reducing mercury emissions while supporting Zambia#s goal of scaling up copper production sustainably.</narrative>
  </description>
